'''Zahkriisos ''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] found within [[Skyrim:Raven Rock Mine|Raven Rock Mine]]. He is found in the final chamber, and serves as the final boss of the quest [[Skyrim:The Final Descent|The Final Descent]].

In addition to being able to [[Skyrim:Conjure Seeker|conjure]] [[Skyrim:Seeker|Seekers]] from [[Skyrim:Apocrypha|Apocrypha]], Zahkriisos excels at lightning-based magic, so much so that at a high enough level, he can single-cast [[Skyrim:Lightning Storm|Lightning Storm]]—a master-level spell—along with [[Skyrim:Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]]. He also knows the spells [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|Greater Ward]] and [[Skyrim:Ebonyflesh|Ebonyflesh]]. 

Upon death, Zahkriisos drops his [[Skyrim:Zahkriisos (item)|eponymous mask]].

