== Notes ==
* Zahkriisos literally means "sword blood" in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|dragon language]], though a more sensible translation might be "bloody sword", possibly a reference to the [[Skyrim:Bloodskal Blade|unique blade]] required to access his tomb.
* Zahkriisos is the lowest level dragon priest in the game, with a minimum level of only 25. All other dragon priests (apart from Miraak) are level 50, or 60. However, he scales with the player's level up to level 60.

